00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.097
first I'm giving you some general remarks

00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:30.210
on how the structure of
your CV, in my opinion,

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.027
should look like, and
then I picked four CVs

00:01:32.027 --> 00:01:33.880
of the CVs that you sent me,

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.087
and we will go in depth into
lots of detail in these CVs,

00:01:37.087 --> 00:01:39.110
and I'm going to make
